     ""\
     "Situation:"\
     "US Army is sending a Rifle Platoon (+) with Bradley support to clear out the town of Rasman, while the Takistan Army is tasked with defending the town with a Light Rifle Platoon and a BMP-1 Platoon"
    }
    GC_Briefing "{DE0901D71EF62BE8}" {
     m_iOrder 1
     m_sTitle "A. Enemy Forces:"
