     m_sTitle "II. Mission:"
     m_sContent "Defend the town of Rasman from the American forces, by utilizing what Urban denseness there is, AT Mine placements and our Platoon of BMPs positioned south (Marked on map) and a Inf PLT south as well delaying the enemy"\
     ""\
